          "content": "\n\n### 代码问题分析：\n\n1. **空指针风险**：\n   - `payChecksQO.getPayCheckNum()`未做空检查，如果payChecksQO或payCheckNum为null会抛NPE\n   - `dto.getPayPlanDate()`未做空检查，如果payPlanDate为null会导致`DateUtils.daysBetween`报错\n\n2. **逻辑缺陷**：\n   - `dto.getSupplierCode()`调用无实际效果，返回值未被使用\n   - 供应商信息查询逻辑存在问题：当supplierCode为null时，使用`PmcPortalLogin.getSupId()`获取供应商ID，但未检查该ID是否有效\n\n3. **异常处理**：\n   - 当`pmcPayChecksMapper.selectOneByExample`返回null时，直接返回空DTO对象，可能导致调用方困惑\n   - `SecurityException`用于业务异常不太合适\n\n4. **性能问题**：\n   - 每次查询都会执行`DateUtils.daysBetween`计算，即使结果未被使用\n\n### 改进建议：\n\n```java\npublic PmcPayChecksSupplierCodeDTO selectPmcPayCheckByPayCheckNum(PayChecksQO payChecksQO) {\n    // 参数校验\n    if (payChecksQO == null || StringUtils.isBlank(payChecksQO.getPayCheckNum())) {\n        throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"付款单号不能为空\");\n    }\n\n    Example example = new Example(PmcPayChecks.class);\n    example.createCriteria().andEqualTo(\"payCheckNum\", payChecksQO.getPayCheckNum());\n    PmcPayChecks pmcPayCheck = pmcPayChecksMapper.selectOneByExample(example);\n    \n    if (pmcPayCheck == null) {\n        return null; // 或抛出自定义异常\n    }\n\n    PmcPayChecksSupplierCodeDTO dto = new PmcPayChecksSupplierCodeDTO();\n    BeanUtils.copyProperties(pmcPayCheck, dto);\n\n    // 仅在需要时计算天数\n    if (dto.getPayPlanDate() != null) {\n        dto.setFinanceDays(DateUtils.daysBetween(DateUtils.getCurrentDate(), dto.getPayPlanDate()));\n    }\n\n    // 供应商信息处理\n    if (StringUtils.isBlank(dto.getSupplierCode())) {\n        String supId = PmcPortalLogin.getSupId();\n        if (StringUtils.isBlank(supId)) {\n            throw new BusinessException(\"未获取到当前登录供应商ID\");\n        }\n        \n        PmcDataP2pSupplier pmcDataP2pSupplier = pmcDataP2pSupplierMapper.selectBySupplierCode(supId);\n        if (pmcDataP2pSupplier == null) {\n            throw new BusinessException(\"供应商信息不存在\");\n        }\n        dto.setSupplierCode(pmcDataP2pSupplier.getSupplierCode());\n        dto.setSupplierName(pmcDataP2pSupplier.getSupplierName());\n    }\n\n    return dto;\n}\n```\n\n需要我查看PayChecksQO类定义来进一步分析吗？或者您有其他具体关注的问题点？",
